# Fig.7-like profile (~200s): keep Link1 static, change Link2 capacity by phase.
# Use with:
#   --scenario fig7
# Server-side path_b egress (h2-eth1) so **pull / download** (h2→h1) is rate-limited.
# (TBF on h1-eth1 would only limit client egress, e.g. ACKs, not media goodput.)
#   0-50s:   20 mbit
#   50-100s: 30 mbit
#   100s-:   10 mbit
IFACE=h2-eth1

0 20
50 30
100 10
